    "updated_at": "2022-04-29T15:54:16Z",
    "body": "Thanks, so I think what we should do here is update the two caller algorithms in https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#host-miscellaneous to preserve a trailing dot in the input in the output. And on top of that we should at least add one example that illustrates trailing dot preservation and ideally also update the same site examples with one example to illustrate the mismatch.\r\n\r\nAnd after that follow-up on the parenthetical in OP.",
